Banks","role":"Interna Principal"},{"id":1223568,"name":"Inés González Guerrico","role":"Rita"},{"id":2138387,"name":"Javier Villamayor","role":"Panchero"},{"id":2138388,"name":"Yvera","role":"Singer"},{"id":2138389,"name":"Chili Yegros","role":"Pitita"},{"id":2138390,"name":"Lucy Yegros","role":"Camele"},{"id":1376053,"name":"Beto Barsotti","role":"Car Buyer"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Le ereditiere","overview":"Chela e Chiquita, entrambe discendenti da famiglie agiate, convivono da oltre trent’anni. Dopo un tracollo finanziario, sono costrette a vendere un po’ alla volta i beni ereditati. Quando Chiquita viene arrestata con un’accusa di frode, Chela è costretta ad affrontare una nuova realtà.  Avendo ripreso a guidare, si improvvisa tassista per un gruppetto di anziane signore benestanti. Nel corso di questa sua nuova vita, Chela incontra Angy, molto più giovane di lei, con cui stabilisce un rapporto molto speciale. Inizia così la sua personalissima e intima rivoluzione…"},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Heiresses","overview":"After her girlfriend is imprisoned on fraud charges, Chela is forced to face a new reality. Driving for the first time in years, she begins to provide a local taxi service to a group of elderly wealthy ladies. As Chela settles into her new life, she encounters the much younger Angy, forging a fresh and invigorating new connection.","tagline":"It's never too late to start over."},{"language":"es-ES","title":"Las herederas","overview":"Desde hace más de 30 años, Chela (66) y Martina (67) viven juntas. Como hijas de familias de buena posición social habían heredado suficiente dinero como para vivir cómodamente sin necesidad de trabajar. Pero ahora, cuando ambas tienen más de 60 años, ese dinero heredado se ha acabado. Cuando Martina va a la cárcel por no poder pagar las deudas que contrajo, Chela empieza a proveer a mujeres mayores de familias acomodadas con un servicio de taxi que le ayuda a poder mantenerse. Así conoce a Angy, una mujer  20 años más joven que ella, con quien conecta de inmediato. Esa conexión va transformando la relación de Chela consigo y con su entorno provocándole una revolución interna."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wtV4jsGC2cAMlaU6UzfIx4nB29S.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Kvf4BUux2wRuSkUluGmdEWnPXo.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":499152,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wtV4jsGC2cAMlaU6UzfIx4nB29S.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wtV4jsGC2cAMlaU6UzfIx4nB29S.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":2857},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wtV4jsGC2cAMlaU6UzfIx4nB29S.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wtV4jsGC2cAMlaU6UzfIx4nB29S.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":2857}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tS94bbXmDKIDIoLgBrGJn3Jbwgv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tS94bbXmDKIDIoLgBrGJn3Jbwgv.jpg","language":"en","width":510,"height":755},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tS94bbXmDKIDIoLgBrGJn3Jbwgv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tS94bbXmDKIDIoLgBrGJn3Jbwgv.jpg","language":"en","width":510,"height":755},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f5snWxyMCKFvbPl98M0XvBUuyjb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f5snWxyMCKFvbPl98M0XvBUuyjb.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rNsVVzWeyRugJfOWKwLVpIz0y8O.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rNsVVzWeyRugJfOWKwLVpIz0y8O.jpg","language":"en","wid